# ── Secrets / generated state — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────
# Defense-in-depth: each project also ignores these, but the root repo catches
# them everywhere (e.g. a365-agent-full/backend/.env holds the blueprint secret).
**/.env
!**/.env.sample
**/a365.generated.config.json
**/*.local.json

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/

# ── Publish / build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
**/manifest.zip
**/appPackage.zip
**/dist/
**/build/

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Obsidian vault (personal notes overlaid on this repo — never commit) ─────
# The repo folder doubles as an Obsidian vault; ignore all of its artifacts.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — keep each comment on its own line.
**/.obsidian/
**/.trash/
*.canvas
# auto-generated Obsidian knowledge base
wiki/
# daily notes (YYYY-MM-DD.md), at root and anywhere
20[0-9][0-9]-[0-1][0-9]-[0-3][0-9].md
**/20[0-9][0-9]-[0-1][0-9]-[0-3][0-9].md
